#: ui/main.qml:140
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The <application>GeoClue2</application> service will be used to periodically "
"update the device's location using GPS or cell tower triangulation if "
"available, or else by sending its IP address to <link url='https://geoip.com/"
"privacy/'>GeoIP</link>."
msgstr ""
"Usluga <application>GeoClue2</application> koristit će se za povremeno "
"ažuriranje položaja uređaja pomoću GPS-a ili triangulacije ćelijskih "
"tornjeva, ako je dostupno, ili pak slanjem IP adrese na <link url='https://"
"geoip.com/privacy/'>GeoIP</link>."

#: ui/main.qml:141
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The <application>%1</application> service will be used to periodically "
"update the device's location. Please open a bug report at <link url='https://"
"bugs.kde.org'>https://bugs.kde.org</link> asking KDE developers to write a "
"detailed description of what this service will do."
msgstr ""
"Usluga <application>%1</application> koristit će se za povremeno ažuriranje "
"položaja uređaja. Otvorite izvještaj o pogrešci na <link url='https://"
"bugs.kde.org'>https://bugs.kde.org</link> i zamolite KDE developere da "
"napišu detaljan opis toga što će ova usluga raditi."

